        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek AP-86347, Cast Bronze Fluted Refrigerator Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Traditional Fluted Cast Bronze Refrigerator Pull has a rustic appearance that will look beautiful on any farmhouse kitchen appliance. It is available in flat black bronze and medium bronze finishes. The Cast Bronze Fluted Appliance Pull is available in either 12 or 18 inch center to center lengths. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Fluted Appliance Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Lost Wax Cast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-AP-86347-specifications.pdf?v=1704262358\"><b>Emtek Fluted Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86347:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86348:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-lost-wax-finish.jpg?v=1704354555\" width=\"394\" height=\"189\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
